            "notes": "## Items\n\n### Core\n- [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) for weapon lifesteal and free overhealth\n\n### Flex\n-  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) for more damage\n-  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) for more lifesteal\n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) or [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for more survivability\n------\n\n## Playstyle\n\nBuild for [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) in oder to have better dueling capabilities,  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) allows you to get free 100 overhealth, in order to get good value out of it, it is better to poke from longer range. You can then go more agressive when that overhealth is built up.",
