            "notes": "## Powers\n\n- Always pick [Keen Kunai](item_d5993121-8a5f-4c59-9145-19dc55265f48) to get more explosive kunais from [Foxy Fireworks](item_d29ac7bb-d84c-44d7-8944-24c9b668b657) \n------\n\n## Items\n\n### Core\n- [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) \n- [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) for more [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) \n- [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) for more [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) \n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \n### Flex\n-  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) if you are rich enough\n-  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) for more survivability\n\n------\n\n## Playstyle\n\nNow that you have 35% [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) , you can go much more agressive (if their dps haven't put you in trouble),  make sure to reload more often as now [Keen Kunai](item_d5993121-8a5f-4c59-9145-19dc55265f48) will give you more explosive kunais if you are at high Ammo (13, 14 and 15 to be precise).",
