            "notes": "## Items\n\n### Core\n- [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) \n- [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) for more [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) \n- [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a)\n- [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) \n- [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) for more [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) \n- [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \n### Flex\n- [Farsight Focus Sash](item_103e6d35-a71f-48c7-b7b9-b89efae62242) for more  [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) \n- [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) if the enemy DPS are rly good\n-  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) if you want to trade survivability for [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) \n------\n\n## Playstyle\n\nNow your Kunais should hurt a lot more, paired with the 35% of [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) that you have, you should be both quite lethal and hard to take down. You can now duel tanks quite well even if you should still duel DPS and go for the enemy supports.",
