            "notes": "## Powers\n\n- Pick [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) most of the time ,the extra survivbility is very useful on this build to enable more agressive plays.\n- Pick [Fleet Foot](item_1d58371c-71a9-44c2-8d5a-0663467599e9) if you need more mobility\n------\n\n## Items\n\n### Core\n- [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) \n- [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c)\n- [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) for more [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal)\n- [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a)\n- [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) \n- [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) for more [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) \n### Flex\n- [Ry\u014dta\u2019s Reloader](item_5cabe555-3845-49fa-9941-71b870c2c164) if you would like to reload fatser and refresh your [Foxy Fireworks](item_d29ac7bb-d84c-44d7-8944-24c9b668b657) with TP or Suzu\n- [Kitsune Kicks](item_55d48620-e8c1-4970-8039-e5c1223d89ed) for more mobility if you picked [Fleet Foot](item_1d58371c-71a9-44c2-8d5a-0663467599e9) \n------\n\n## Playstyle\n\nIf you have [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b), you can use it offensively if you decied to buy [Ry\u014dta\u2019s Reloader](item_5cabe555-3845-49fa-9941-71b870c2c164).\nIf you have [Fleet Foot](item_1d58371c-71a9-44c2-8d5a-0663467599e9), you can go for a lot of deep flanks, you can also go for [Ry\u014dta\u2019s Reloader](item_5cabe555-3845-49fa-9941-71b870c2c164) to use your TP as a reload to proc [Foxy Fireworks](item_d29ac7bb-d84c-44d7-8944-24c9b668b657) again.",
