            "notes": "## Powers\n\n- Pick [Spirit Veil](item_1772ce7d-37ed-41e4-8bac-d9b260aa59ad) if you find yourself getting 3 ults or more per round.\n- Pick [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68) if you picked [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) and the enemy team has a lot of debuffs.\n- Pick [Fleet Foot](item_1d58371c-71a9-44c2-8d5a-0663467599e9) if you need more mobility\n- Pick [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) if you didn't on round 5\n------\n\n## Items\n\n### Core\n- [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) \n- [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c)\n- [Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8)\n- [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a)\n- [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124)\n- [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) \n\n### Flex\n\n- [Ry\u014dta\u2019s Reloader](item_5cabe555-3845-49fa-9941-71b870c2c164) if you would like to reload fatser and refresh your [Foxy Fireworks](item_d29ac7bb-d84c-44d7-8944-24c9b668b657) with TP or Suzu\n- [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) for more survivability\n- [Kitsune Kicks](item_55d48620-e8c1-4970-8039-e5c1223d89ed) for more mobility if you picked [Fleet Foot](item_1d58371c-71a9-44c2-8d5a-0663467599e9)\n- [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) if you can't afford every core item\n------\n\n## Playstyle\n\nPlay like you did during round 5 and 6. If you got [Spirit Veil](item_1772ce7d-37ed-41e4-8bac-d9b260aa59ad), use your Kitsune Rush agressivery and use the 4s of invincibility to get a free kill.",
